{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "仅在你主动选择并授权后，应用才会以只读方式访问 .codex 文件夹，用于显示任务状态、对话标题、本机 Token 统计和官方用量快照。当你主动使用“发现待办”时，应用还会在本机分析最近对话正文。对话内容不会上传，应用也不会读取、复制或保存 Codex 登录凭据。": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "The app accesses your .codex folder in read-only mode only after you select and authorize it. This access is used to show task status, conversation titles, local token totals, and official usage snapshots. When you use Find Tasks, the app also analyzes recent conversation text locally on your Mac. Conversation content is never uploaded, and the app never reads, copies, or stores Codex sign-in credentials." } } }
    },
    "最后更新：2026 年 8 月 21 日": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Last updated: August 21, 2026" } } }
    },
    "请选择个人目录中的 .codex 文件夹。应用以只读方式处理任务状态、用量和对话正文；对话仅在本机用于发现待办，不会上传或读取登录凭据。": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Choose the .codex folder in your home directory. The app processes task status, usage, and conversation text with read-only access. Conversation text is used only on this Mac to find tasks; it is never uploaded, and sign-in credentials are never read." } } }
    },
    "Codex 待办": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Codex Tasks" } } }
    },
    "从 Codex 发现待办": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Find Tasks from Codex" } } }
    },
    "从最近 Codex 对话中提取待办候选": {
      "localizations": { "en": { "stringUnit": { "state": "translated", "value": "Find task candidates in recent Codex conversations" } } }
    },
