    "应用不收集个人数据，不使用分析或广告 SDK，不跟踪用户，也不会把 .codex 文件夹内容发送给开发者或任何第三方服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app doesn’t collect personal data, use analytics or advertising SDKs, track you, or send the contents of your .codex folder to the developer or any third-party server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "应用设置、任务读取断点、安全作用域书签和你主动录制或导入的提醒音频，只保存在这台 Mac 的应用容器中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App settings, task checkpoints, security-scoped bookmarks, and alert audio you record or import are stored only in the app container on this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
